<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>ruby and obsolete inline elements</title></head>
<body>
<ruby>漢<rt>kan<rp>(</rp>字<rt>ji</ruby>
<p><bdo dir="sideways">abc</bdo><bdi dir="rtl">xyz</bdi>
<font face="A&B" size="999" color="rgb(0,0,999)"><center>
<marquee behavior=scroll direction=diagonal loop=-1 scrollamount=0>
<blink><strike><tt>old <big>markup</small></tt></strike></blink>
</marquee></center></font>
<address><a href="mailto:a@b?subject=x&body=y">a@b</address>
<ins datetime="not-a-date"><del cite=":::" datetime="2024-99-99">changed</ins></del>
<q cite="javascript:foo()">quote <sup><sub>x</sup>y</sub>
<code><var><samp><kbd>mix</code> end</kbd></samp></var>
<hr noshade="false" size="18446744073709551616" width="-0.5">
<wbr><br><br/ ><hr/ >
<p title="unclosed attribute><span>after quote</span>
<div style="color:red; width: expression(alert(1));"><!-- nested <!-- comment --> end -->
</body>
</html>